{
  "about": "Row Marks as GridSource.from keeps them (ADR-0043): by identity, \"all\" the result at the press, and a positional gesture resolved only under the order it was made in. Transcribed from the C# facts of RowMarkSourceTests, which they replace.",
  "kind": "source",
  "columns": [{"name": "Book", "type": "text"}, {"name": "Amount", "type": "number"}],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043: one checkbox marks one row, and only that row",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"markRow": 1, "marked": true},
        {"expect": {"marked": [1], "markCounts": [1, 4, 0]}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043: \"all\" marks every row of the current result",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"markAll": true},
        {"expect": {"marked": [0, 1, 2, 3], "markHeader": "all"}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043: \"all\" never reaches rows the filter has hidden",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"setFilter": {"columns": {"Amount": {"clauses": [{"operator": "greaterThanOrEqual", "value": 3}]}}}},
        {"markAll": true},
        {"expect": {"marked": [0, 3], "markCounts": [2, 2, 0]}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043: \"all\" pressed over a result the Filter has since changed marks nothing",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"setFilter": {"columns": {"Amount": {"clauses": [{"operator": "greaterThanOrEqual", "value": 3}]}}}},
        {"markAll": true, "version": 0},
        {"expect": {"version": 1, "marked": [], "marksHeard": 0}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043 (MK-5): marks stay on the same rows after a sort",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"markRow": 2, "marked": true},
        {"setSorts": [{"column": "Amount", "direction": "ascending"}]},
        {"expect": {"window": [1, 2, 0, 3], "marked": [2], "windowMarks": [false, true, false, false]}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043: a value update replaces the object, and the mark follows the row",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"markRow": 0, "marked": true},
        {"replaceRow": 0, "with": ["Alpha", 30]},
        {"expect": {"marked": [0], "markCounts": [1, 4, 0]}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043 (MK-7): narrowing the filter keeps the marks and counts the ones outside it",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"markAll": true},
        {"setFilter": {"columns": {"Amount": {"clauses": [{"operator": "greaterThanOrEqual", "value": 3}]}}}},
        {"expect": {"markCounts": [2, 2, 2]}},
        {"setFilter": null},
        {"expect": {"marked": [0, 1, 2, 3], "markCounts": [4, 4, 0]}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043 (MK-8): a row that joins the result after \"all\" is not marked, and the header turns to \"some\"",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"setFilter": {"columns": {"Amount": {"clauses": [{"operator": "greaterThanOrEqual", "value": 3}]}}}},
        {"markAll": true},
        {"replaceRow": 1, "with": ["Beta", 10]},
        {"expect": {"window": [0, 1, 3], "marked": [0, 3], "markHeader": "some"}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043: pressing \"all\" from all unmarks the current result, and only it",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"markAll": true},
        {"setFilter": {"columns": {"Amount": {"clauses": [{"operator": "greaterThanOrEqual", "value": 3}]}}}},
        {"markAll": false},
        {"expect": {"marked": [1, 2], "markCounts": [0, 2, 2]}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043 (MK-1): a positional gesture over a mixed block marks all of it",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"markRow": {"window": 1}, "marked": true},
        {"markPositions": [{"start": 0, "count": 3}]},
        {"expect": {"windowMarks": [true, true, true, false]}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043 (MK-1): a positional gesture over an all-marked block unmarks it",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"markAll": true},
        {"markPositions": [{"start": 1, "count": 2}]},
        {"expect": {"windowMarks": [true, false, false, true]}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043 (MK-3): positions made under another order are refused, since they would name other rows",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"setSorts": [{"column": "Amount", "direction": "ascending"}]},
        {"markPositions": [{"start": 0, "count": 2}], "version": 0},
        {"expect": {"version": 1, "marked": [], "marksHeard": 0}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043, ADR-0024: Group and Total rows are never marked and never counted",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"rowKind": {"column": "Book", "kinds": {"Gamma": "total"}}},
        {"markAll": true},
        {"markRow": 2, "marked": true},
        {"expect": {"marked": [0, 1, 3], "markCounts": [3, 3, 0]}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043: each gesture is one change, heard once",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"markAll": true},
        {"markRow": 0, "marked": false},
        {"expect": {"marksHeard": 2}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043: the marks an action runs over are rows, in the source's order, never positions",
      "rows": [
        ["Alpha", 3],
        ["Beta", 1],
        ["Gamma", 2],
        ["Delta", 4]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"markRow": 3, "marked": true},
        {"markRow": 1, "marked": true},
        {"setSorts": [{"column": "Amount", "direction": "descending"}]},
        {"expect": {"markedRows": [["Beta", 1], ["Delta", 4]]}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-0043, ADR-0003: an object handed over twice is one row by identity, counted once and listed once, and a replacement at one place takes the mark with it",
      "rows": [
        ["Twice", 5],
        ["Once", 1],
        {"sameAs": 0}
      ],
      "steps": [
        {"setColumns": true},
        {"markRow": 0, "marked": true},
        {"expect": {"marked": [0, 2], "markCounts": [1, 2, 0], "markedRows": [["Twice", 5]]}},
        {"replaceRow": 0, "with": ["Twice", 6]},
        {"expect": {"window": [0, 1, 0], "marked": [0, 2], "markCounts": [2, 3, 0], "markedRows": [["Twice", 6], ["Twice", 5]]}}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
